    },
    {
      "t": "S",
      "v": "Steve from <i>Blue’s Clues</i> is wrongly charged with murder and Blue must mount a desperate defense for the trial.",
      "n": "QuestionText1"
    },
    {
      "s": "Justice poilue et adorable ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "743264_1",
      "n": "CategoryAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Cela PROUVE que quelqu'un a commis un crime. Imaginez Blue entrant au tribunal avec « l’album de meurtre » de Steve. ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "743276_1",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio3"
    },
    {
      "s": "Imaginez-le... ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "743265_1",
      "n": "IntroAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "743267_1",
      "n": "ChoicesAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "\"Votre honneur, Mme Pepper dit qu'elle n'a jamais vu Steve assassiner qui que ce soit. En avons-nous fini ici ?\" ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "743274_1",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio2"
    },
    {
      "s": "C’est une preuve qui ne peut littéralement pas être utilisée devant un tribunal. MAUVAIS. CHIEN. ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "743272_1",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio1"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "Intro2Audio"
    },
    {
      "s": "That’s evidence that directly disproves someone committed a crime.",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "743269_1",
      "n": "ExplanationAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "If anyone’s going to jail, it’s that mailbox. I’m mean, talk about a red flag...",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "743270_1",
      "n": "JokeAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Steve from <i>Blue’s Clues</i> is wrongly charged with murder and Blue must mount a desperate defense for the trial. What kind of clues are Blue looking for?",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "743266_2",
      "n": "QuestionAudio"
    }
  ]
